    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structVertex" kindref="compound">Vertex</ref> equivalence for common subgraph isomorphism.</para><para>Determines when a pair of vertices, one from each of two graphs, can be considered isomorphic. This class serves as both a model for those wishing to write their own formulation of equivalence, and as the default implementation when none is provided by the user. </para>    </detaileddescription>
